#. Translators: The developer's name
#: desktop/net.donnybeelo.Convey.metainfo.xml.in.in:14
msgid "Daniel Elia"
msgstr ""

#: desktop/net.donnybeelo.Convey.metainfo.xml.in.in:19
msgid ""
"Convey is an email application built around conversations, for the GNOME "
"desktop. It allows you to read, find and send email with a straightforward, "
"modern interface."
msgstr ""
"Convey 是个 GNOME 桌面下围绕会话构建的电子邮件应用。它允许您使用一个直观、现"
"代的用户界面阅读、查找和发送电子邮件。"

#: desktop/net.donnybeelo.Convey.metainfo.xml.in.in:24
msgid ""
"Conversations allow you to read a complete discussion without having to find "
"and click from message to message."
msgstr "会话允许您阅读一个完整讨论而不用一条条消息的查找和点击。"

#: desktop/net.donnybeelo.Convey.metainfo.xml.in.in:28
msgid ""
"Convey is a fork of Geary, originally developed by the Geary Development "
"Team and the Software Freedom Conservancy."
msgstr ""

